## Model card

- **Name:** Claude 3.5 Haiku
- **Short description:** Anthropic’s Claude 3.5 Haiku (Oct 2024) is a small/fast Claude model (200K context, 8K max output) now retired; it offered low-cost text/image/PDF understanding relative to its era.
- **Provider / access:** Anthropic API (retired 2026-02-19). Local metadata lists `anthropic/claude-3-5-haiku-20241022`, final pricing $0.80/$4.00 per 1M, and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Model card addendum referenced in metadata. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in accessible reviewed content.
- **IDs:** `claude-3-5-haiku-20241022`.
- **Context window:** 200,000 tokens total; 8,192 max output.
- **Modalities:** Text, image, and PDF input; text output (text-only at launch per metadata).
- **Pricing (as of retirement/final):** $0.80/$4.00 per 1M in/out, $0.08 cached read (local metadata).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary closed model. Architecture/parameter count not publicly disclosed.

